{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b75b3ab31bd9052f9d403fd12a3597a792fd607ff5a99a349ce0a800ad76ceeb", "ja": "（茜のステージが終わった。始まる前は、多少の\n不安もあったけど……お客さんの反応が答えだな！）", "zh": "（茜的表演结束了。开始前多少还有些不安……\n但观众的反应就是答案！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "758f80d9d1203c8a65b7a2509f0f807c5845662178c6ae4930321e32f7593120", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃ～ん！", "zh": "小{$P$}～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bad42901c37367ba7949e6c9125905ec69881c1536b5321d142b1046adefd6e1", "ja": "茜、お疲れさま！　やったな。", "zh": "茜，辛苦了！你表现得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "cd4d2e12a4a587b465754f56f8591674e4570ecb24eb4c8f5a82395c1bd6d323", "ja": "ふっふっふ……いや～、さすが茜ちゃん！\nチョー盛り上がっちゃったよね♪", "zh": "哼哼哼……哎呀～真不愧是小茜！\n气氛超热烈的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "72b96fcfd4be8d7cc7f9cdd35a1b34b1f91dac23f19d2c1ddb58847081485ad1", "ja": "この鳴り止まないアンコールが、何よりの証拠……。\n来てる、来てるよ！　茜ちゃんの時代が！", "zh": "这停不下来的安可声，就是最好的证据……\n小茜的时代到来了！到来了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_1005_p", "source_sha256": "dc0f2b30a82cce065115e0ea058296d7a1f579b800b6fa2949cc0de7e406fc8d", "ja": "うん、そうかもしれないな。\nそれじゃ、このままアンコール行けそうか？", "zh": "嗯，也许真是如此呢。\n那么，你还能直接上场安可吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "a981a96ab05d0a5450d32402ddbf052c2bce125c25c3be66159807e318600a06", "ja": "それなんだけどね、{$P$}ちゃん。\n実は茜ちゃん、もう立ってるのがやっとで……。", "zh": "问题就出在这里啊，小{$P$}。\n其实小茜已经连站着都很勉强了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_1007_p", "source_sha256": "731fd330c6f547067fabf0c9717f870fe122119431cb10944a4411fb1c265b3c", "ja": "えっ、そうなのか？\n大変だ、すぐに休憩を……。", "zh": "咦，是吗？\n那糟了，得赶快休息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "c5f15645a9015d2e68e17ab42631434df7c92f33aa77a6caf6463bb5f3298556", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、待って！　茜ちゃん\n平気だから……。あの……あのパワーさえあれば……！", "zh": "小{$P$}，等一下！\n小茜没事的……只要……只要有那份力量的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "a8065c043ebade347a518bd6abf7fff537cfcaab6a7ed8d44abd5f0f3acfb748", "ja": "そう、ナデナデさえあれば……茜ちゃんの頭を、\n誰かがものすごくナデナデしてくれれば！　あるいは！", "zh": "对，只要有摸摸头的话……\n如果某人拚命摸摸小茜的头！搞不好就可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cdd4aaa17bc4603a8fd85ac5453933169b42613bfc80d71bf9c69eb279cbd6f1", "ja": "ああ、なるほど。そういうことなら……。", "zh": "哦哦，我懂了。既然如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_1011", "source_sha256": "f0724b17f8a13937f8e2c17bb762442be95ef9921aec14724e9ed40d8fe80990", "ja": "ナデナデ", "zh": "摸摸头", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_2000_p", "source_sha256": "924411fa12a685b2d1bf58210f2433fc8876f6a7f38de0312a47ca7235f6c7b8", "ja": "ほら、茜。ナデナデだぞ。", "zh": "来，茜，摸摸头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_2001_023aka", "source_sha256": "24949d381abd7f1f19f16e79a7a6f52ad5cca30502b86033c1c0a7f8a49267ac", "ja": "ふにゃあぁ～♪\nゴロゴロゴロゴロ～……♪", "zh": "呼呀啊啊～♪\n呼噜呼噜呼噜……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_2002_023aka", "source_sha256": "f579eaa93fd4f0bc3ce2bfc7cea05fe70f22b9f5a514eca6287ed176494b8dff", "ja": "ゴロゴロゴロゴロ……ゴロゴロ……ゴロ……って、\n{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "呼噜呼噜呼噜……呼噜呼噜……呼噜……\n喂，小{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_2003_023aka", "source_sha256": "7612692e912448dbf102e202848000db081857440b914d76fc9f756c60a46c45", "ja": "うにゃ～！？　ストップ、ストーップ！\nそれ以上は！　摩擦でなんか頭から熱が！！", "zh": "呜呀～！？停下来，停下来──！\n再摸下去！就要摩擦到头顶发热了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_2004_p", "source_sha256": "db759ec46dfab2df937d045852cc5e3d3e077e30d152407f325042a86922d89b", "ja": "あっ！　す、すまない……茜、大丈夫か？", "zh": "啊！抱、抱歉……茜，你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_2005_023aka", "source_sha256": "9e519fac220412723e814fc04c1382af54841a57412cc101c43d825bdbdfa68d", "ja": "ふぅ～、ビックリした。ま、でも充電完了！\n超茜ちゃん、爆☆誕！", "zh": "呼～吓了小茜一跳，但充电完毕了！\n超级小茜，诞☆生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_2006_023aka", "source_sha256": "07fc2549bc69ada1189afe7264970faf2d934ad68bf76891f3ff60d6822c4a32", "ja": "んじゃ、ちょっとだけアンコール行ってくるね♪\nライブが終わったら、今度はごほうびナデナデだよ！", "zh": "那小茜就稍微去安可一下啰♪\n等演唱会结束后，接下来是奖励的摸摸头喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_2007_023aka", "source_sha256": "532dcfd30314b33cf8ae5378b46dbccbc514d5f8c28441e165278cee743de47f", "ja": "みんな～、おまたせ～！　カワイイカワイイ\n茜ちゃんが、ステージに帰ってきたよ～！", "zh": "大家～久等了～！\n可爱到不行的小茜，回到舞台上啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0054_2008_p", "source_sha256": "239573c018b0a4908556b234daf9b4fb6fc2e9fd9ad3fab6d38ab17cf46caabc", "ja": "（茜が、楽しそうな笑顔でステージへと駆けていく。\nきっとお客さん達の事も、笑顔にしてしまうだろう）", "zh": "（茜带着开心的笑脸跑向舞台。\n她一定也会让观众们都面露笑容吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
